plus the exact `config.yaml` needed to repeat that run. ([GitHub][12])

More importantly, trajectories can be converted into **demonstrations** for subsequent agents. ([GitHub][12])

That's directly relevant to:

```text
WorkerRun
     ↓
won $20 bounty
     ↓
extract successful trajectory
     ↓
generalise
     ↓
Skill / Recipe / WorkerProcess
     ↓
test
     ↓
Worker vNext
```

Their trajectory viewer concepts are also worth borrowing for your dashboard.

